# FINORA Public Release Repository — Git Hygiene
# DILARANG menyimpan binary APK, keystore, atau secret apa pun di dalam Git history!
# File APK hanya boleh diunggah sebagai GitHub Release Assets.

# Android & Binary Packages (NEVER commit to Git history)
*.apk
*.aab
*.apks
*.ipa
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.exe
*.msi

# Signing Keystores, Certificates & Secrets (NEVER commit)
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pk8
*.pem
*.key
keystore.properties
signing.properties
.env
.env.*
*.secret
*.token

# OS, Editor & Temporary Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.sw?
